      "maintainer": "Garfius <garfius@gmail.com>",
      "sentence": "Half-duplex file transfer using the XModem and XModem/CRC protocols over any Stream.",
      "paragraph": "Send and receive whole files to/from an SD card (or LittleFS) using the classic XMODEM (128-byte blocks, 8-bit checksum) or XMODEM/CRC (CRC-16/XMODEM) protocols. Provides progress, error, and overwrite-confirmation callbacks, plus configurable block id size, checksum size, data size, retry limit, and signal-retry delay for non-standard peers.",
      "category": "Communication",
      "architectures": [
        "*"
      ],
      "depends": [
        "SD"
      ],
